        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo, mupostolo wa Kilisto Yesu bu mudi mukenshi wa Nzambi Musungidi wetu, ne wa Kilisto Yesu ditekemena dietu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kudi Timote, muanʼanyi wa bushua mu ditabusha: Ngasa, luse, ditalala bia kudi Nzambi Tatu ne kudi Kilisto Yesu Mukelenge wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu munakakusengelela bua wewe kushala mu Efeso, hanakadi nya ku Makedonia, bua wewe kuelela bakuabo mukenshi ne, Kanuyishi bantu diyisha dikuabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kanulamatshi ku nsumuinu ya tshianana, anyi ku mena a hankambua malongolola adi kâl ne ndekelu; malu â adi avuisha dikonkangana, kêna avuisha kudiunda kua mudimu wa Nzambi kudi ditabusha: udi nkusengelela muomumue katataka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tshidi mukenshi eu ukeba kuheta ndinanga dia mu mutshima mutoke ne dia mu muoyomukese muimpe ne dia mu ditabusha didi kadi ne lubombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku malu â bantu bakuabo bamane kuhambuka bakasesuka bua kulonda biakulakula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badi basue kuikala bayishi ba mikenshi ya Nzambi, kadi kabena bajingulula tshidibo bamba anyi tshidibo bakeba kujadika ne, Ntshilelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tudi bamanye ne, Mikenshi idi mimpe bikala muntu wilonda ne kutumikila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudi bamanye ne, Mikenshi kayena mielela muntu muakane, kadi idi mielela badi kabai baitabusha ne bena buhidia ne badi kabai banemekela Nzambi ne badi babi ne badi kabai ba tshijila ne bahendi ha Nzambi ne bashihi ba batatu ne bamamu ne bashihianganyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bena masandi, balume badi benzelangana malu a bundu, banyengi ba bantu, bena mashimi, bena mitshihu ya mashimi, anyi bikalaku tshinga tshintu tshidi tshifuilangana ne diyisha dimpe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bu mudi lumu luimpe lua butumbi bua Nzambi udibo batumbisha, luakatekibua mu bianza bianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi musakidile Kilisto Yesu Mukelenge wetu mene, wakampa bukole bualu bua yeye wakambala bu muntu udi mua kueyemenyibua, wakanteka ku mudimu wandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "diambedi nakadi muhendi wa Nzambi ne mukengeshi wa bantu bandi ne muena luonji kudibo; kadi nakafuidibua luse bualu bua nakabienza mu buhidia buanyi tshi mumanye: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne ngasa wa Mukelenge wetu wakatamba kuvulangana diatshimue ne ditabusha ne dinanga dia mu Kilisto Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî edi didi mua kueyemenyibua ndidi bonso bamanye mua kuitabusha ne, Kilisto Yesu wakaluila ha buloba bua kusungileye bantu babi, bandi ku mpala kuabo ku bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bua bualu ebu nakafuidibua luse, bua munda muanyi bu muntu mubi muhite bakuabo, Yesu Kilisto amueneshe lutulu luandi luonso, bu tshileshilu kudi bantu balua kumuitabusha tô ne ku muoyo wa tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi Mukelenge wa kashidi, udi kai mua kufua, udi kai mua kumuenebua ku mesu, Nzambi umue, buneme ne butumbi bikale kudiye ku bikondo ne ku bikondo. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nkutekela mukenshi eu, muanʼanyi Timote, bu mudi mei a baprofete akadianjilabo kuamba bua bualu buebe, bua wewe uluangane nvita mimpe ne dikuatshisha diau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulamate ditabusha ne muoyo-mukese muimpe; bakuabo bakumusha malu â kudibo, bakanyanguka mu ditabusha diabo bu mudi majua matshibuke mu mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munkatshi muabo mudi Humenayo ne Alesandelo; banakafila kudi Satana, bua bayishibue ne, Kanuhendi Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
